[{'Entries': [{'IntroText': 'This code attempts to take on the privileges of a user before creating a file, thus avoiding performing the action with unnecessarily high privileges:'}, {'Nature': 'Bad', 'Language': 'C++', 'ExampleCode': '```
	bool DoSecureStuff(HANDLE hPipe) {
