	az storage account update --name <storage-account> --resource-group <resource-group> --allow-blob-public-access false
```'}]}, {'ID': 'DX-161', 'Entries': [{'IntroText': "The following Google Cloud Storage command gets the settings for a storage account named 'BUCKET_NAME':"}, {'Nature': 'Informative', 'Language': 'Shell', 'ExampleCode': '```
