[{'Entries': [{'IntroText': "In this example, a cookie is used to store a session ID for a client's interaction with a website. The intention is that the cookie will be sent to the website with each request made by the client."}, {'BodyText': 'The snippet of code below establishes a new cookie to hold the sessionID.'}, {'Nature': 'Bad', 'Language': 'Java', 'ExampleCode': '```
