```'}, {'BodyText': 'When the client loads and executes this script, it makes a request to the attacker-controlled web site. The attacker can then log the request and steal the cookie.'}, {'BodyText': 'To mitigate the risk, use the setHttpOnly(true) method.'}, {'Nature': 'Good', 'Language': 'Java', 'ExampleCode': '```
