[{'Entries': [{'IntroText': 'The classic example of a write-what-where condition occurs when the accounting information for memory allocations is overwritten in a particular fashion. Here is an example of potentially vulnerable code:'}, {'Nature': 'Bad', 'Language': 'C', 'ExampleCode': '```
