[{'Entries': [{'IntroText': 'This method is part of a singleton pattern, yet the following singleton() pattern is not thread-safe. It is possible that the method will create two objects instead of only one.'}, {'Nature': 'Bad', 'Language': 'Java', 'ExampleCode': '```
