```"}, {'BodyText': 'This code demonstrates the transfer of a secret key using a Parallel-In/Parallel-Out shift. In a parallel shift, data confounded by multiple bits of the key, not just one.'}, {'Nature': 'Good', 'Language': 'Verilog', 'ExampleCode': "module pipo(clk,rst,a,q);

```
	 input clk,rst;
