[{'Entries': [{'IntroText': 'The following Java example contains a function to compute an average but does not validate that the input value used as the denominator is not zero. This will create an exception for attempting to divide by zero. If this error is not handled by Java exception handling, unexpected results can occur.'}, {'Nature': 'Bad', 'Language': 'Java', 'ExampleCode': '```
