		}
		return totalTime / numRequests;
	}
```'}]}, {'Entries': [{'IntroText': 'The following C/C++ example contains a function that divides two numeric values without verifying that the input value used as the denominator is not zero. This will create an error for attempting to divide by zero, if this error is not caught by the error handling capabilities of the language, unexpected results can occur.'}, {'Nature': 'Bad', 'Language': 'C', 'ExampleCode': '```
