	$fh = GetServerFileHandle("myserver");

	print $fh "$cmd $argstr\n";'}, {'BodyText': 'It is clear that, while the protocol and back-end allow multiple commands to be sent in a single request, the front end only intends to send a single command. However, the UrlEncode function could leave the "|" character intact. If an attacker provides:'}, {'Nature': 'Attack', 'ExampleCode': '```
