	SELECT * FROM items WHERE owner = <userName> AND itemname = <itemName>;
```'}, {'BodyText': 'However, because the query is constructed dynamically by concatenating a constant base query string and a user input string, the query only behaves correctly if itemName does not contain a single-quote character. If an attacker with the user name wiley enters the string:'}, {'Nature': 'Attack', 'ExampleCode': "```
