```'}, {'BodyText': 'This simplification of the query allows the attacker to bypass the requirement that the query only return items owned by the authenticated user; the query now returns all entries stored in the items table, regardless of their specified owner.'}]}, {'ID': 'DX-210', 'Entries': [{'IntroText': 'The code below constructs an LDAP query using user input address data:'}, {'Nature': 'Bad', 'Language': 'Java', 'ExampleCode': '```
